The Opaline Reserve is a racketeering operation hosted in a brewery in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]] district of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Suspected by the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes]] convox to be committing illegal augury within the city limits. The Reserve grew out of a distillery and moved into other substances. It rarely turns to violent crime, and the convox left it alone until a murder in its territory led the investigators to the augers in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]].
